{{ dkim_managed_comment | comment(prefix='', postfix='') | trim }}
AutoRestart             Yes
AutoRestartRate         10/1h
UMask                   002
Syslog                  yes
SyslogSuccess           Yes
LogWhy                  Yes
ReportAddress           {{ dkim_admin_email }}

Canonicalization        relaxed/simple

ExternalIgnoreList      refile:{{ dkim_opendkim_config_dir }}/TrustedHosts
InternalHosts           refile:{{ dkim_opendkim_config_dir }}/TrustedHosts
KeyTable                refile:{{ dkim_key_table_path }}
SigningTable            refile:{{ dkim_signing_table_path }}

Mode                    sv
PidFile                 /var/run/opendkim/opendkim.pid
SignatureAlgorithm      rsa-sha256

UserID                  {{ dkim_user }}:{{ dkim_group }}

Socket                  inet:{{ dkim_milter_port }}@localhost

